/-!
# Architecture utilization atlas

This umbrella exports proof-bearing regime comparisons for predictive coding,
typed workspaces, and belief networks.  `Core` supplies concrete outcome and
Pareto semantics; later modules instantiate the belief, inference, plasticity,
workspace, recommendation, diagnostic, and diagnostic-identifiability frontiers.
The active-probing layer compiles primitive trajectories and selected
interventions into theorem-licensed architecture decisions.  The scoped
BP-subsumption audit constructively classifies the named predictive-coding
training mechanisms while preserving local execution as a separate axis.  The
online-adaptation crown adds finite-settling error, retention-constrained BP,
moving-target regret, and frozen-adapter Jacobian reachability.
-/
